  [HIGH] hints.cc:874  text += "early monsters look like <brown>r</brown>, <green>l</green>, "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:875  text += "<brown>K</brown> or <lightgrey>g</lightgrey>. "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:878  text += "Your console settings allowing, you'll always see a "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:879  text += "list of monsters somewhere on the screen.\n"
  [HIGH] hints.cc:881  text += "You can gain information about it by pressing <w>x</w> and "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:882  text += "moving the cursor over the monster, and read the monster "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:883  text += "description by then pressing <w>v</w>. "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:886  text += "\nTo attack this monster with your wielded weapon, just move "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:887  text += "into it. "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:891  text += "Note that as long as there's a non-friendly monster in view you "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:892  text += "won't be able to automatically move to distant squares, to avoid "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:893  text += "death by misclicking."
  [HIGH] hints.cc:909  text += "First <w>w</w>ield it, then follow the instructions."
  [HIGH] hints.cc:910  text += "<tiles>\nAs a short-cut you can also <w>right-click</w> on your "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:911  text += "shortbow to read its description, and <w>left-click</w> to wield "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:912  text += "it.</tiles>"
  [HIGH] hints.cc:916  text += "<tiles>Clicking with your <w>right mouse button</w> on your "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:917  text += "shortbow will also let you read its description.</tiles>"
  [HIGH] hints.cc:980  text += "HINT_SEEN_PORTAL_2"
  [HIGH] hints.cc:1908  result += "%ap"
  [HIGH] hints.cc:1917  result += "</w> fires at the same target again."
  [HIGH] hints.cc:1939  m += "\n\nA spell that isn't <darkgray>grayed out</darkgray> or "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:1940  m += "<lightred>forbidden</lightred> can be "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:1941  m += "memorised right away by selecting it at this menu."
  [HIGH] hints.cc:1945  m += "\n\nYou cannot memorise any "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:1946  m += "more "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:1947  m += "spells right now. This will change as you grow in levels and "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:1948  m += "Spellcasting proficiency. "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:1953  m += "\n\nTo use magic, "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:1962  m += "you can press <w>%</w> and choose a spell, e.g. <w>a</w> (check "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:1963  m += "with <w>?</w>). For attack spells you'll "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:1987  str += "first <w>%</w>ield it"
  [HIGH] hints.cc:1991  str += "first <w>%</w>ear it"
  [HIGH] hints.cc:1995  str += "first <w>%</w>ut it on"
  [HIGH] hints.cc:1999  str += "<r>(BUG! this item shouldn't give an ability)</r>"
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2002  str += ", then "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2004  str += "enter the ability menu with <w>%</w>, and then "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2005  str += "choose the corresponding ability. Note that such an attempt of "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2006  str += "activation, especially by the untrained, is likely to fail."
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2022  result += "</w> for"
