  [HIGH] directn.cc:686  desc << " (not visited)"
  [HIGH] hints.cc:1504  text << " just excommunicated you "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:1504  text << "Uh-oh, "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:1505  text << "for running out of piety (your divine favour went "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:1506  text << "to nothing). Maybe you repeatedly violated the "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:1507  text << "religious rules, or maybe you failed to please your "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:1508  text << "deity often enough, or some combination of the two. "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:1509  text << "If you can find an altar dedicated to "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:1514  text << "Should you decide that abandoning "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:1515  text << "wasn't such a smart move after all, and you'd like to "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:1516  text << "return to your old faith, you'll have to find an "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:1517  text << " where"
  [HIGH] hints.cc:1517  text << "altar dedicated to "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:1519  text << " you can re-convert, and all will be well."
  [HIGH] hints.cc:1523  text << "Otherwise, you'll have to weather this god's "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:1524  text << "displeasure until their divine wrath is spent."
  [HIGH] hints.cc:1535  text << "Fortunately, it seems that "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:1536  text << " didn't mind your converting to "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:1540  text << "You even kept some of your piety! "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:1542  text << "Note that this kind of alliance only exists "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:1543  text << "between the three good gods, so don't expect this "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:1544  text << "to be the norm."
  [HIGH] hints.cc:1548  text << "Fortunately, it seems that "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:1549  text << " didn't mind your converting to "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:1550  text << " is one of "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:1550  text << ". That's because "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:1551  text << "the good gods who generally are rather forgiving "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:1552  text << "about change of faith - unless you switch over to "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:1553  text << "the path of evil, in which case their retribution "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:1554  text << "can be nasty indeed!"
  [HIGH] hints.cc:1558  text << " didn't "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:1558  text << "Looks like "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:1559  text << "appreciate your converting to "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:1560  text << "! But really, changing from one of the good gods "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:1561  text << "to an evil one, what did you expect!? For any god "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:1562  text << "not on the opposing side of the faith, "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:1563  text << " would have been much more "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:1564  text << "forgiving. "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:1571  text << " didn't appreciate "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:1571  text << "Looks like "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:1572  text << "! (Actually, "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:1572  text << "your converting to "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:1573  text << "only the three good gods will usually be forgiving "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:1574  text << "about this kind of faithlessness.) "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:1581  text << "Unfortunately, while converting back would appease "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:1582  text << ", it would annoy "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:1583  text << ", so you're stuck with having to suffer the wrath of "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:1584  text << "one god or another."
  [HIGH] hints.cc:1765  text << " are good things to check."
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2073  ostr << "When wielded, some weapons (such as this one) "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2074  ostr << "offer certain abilities you can activate. "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2081  ostr << "\nThis weapon offers its wearer protection from "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2082  ostr << "certain damage sources. For an overview of your "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2083  ostr << "resistances (among other things) press <w>%</w>"
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2085  ostr << " or click on your avatar with the <w>right mouse "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2098  ostr << "You can wield this weapon with <w>%</w>, or use "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2099  ostr << "<w>%</w> to switch between the weapons in slot "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2100  ostr << "a and b. (Use <w>%i</w> to adjust item slots.)"
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2121  ostr << "\nHowever, you've been training in <w>"
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2123  ostr << "</w> for a while, so maybe you should "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2124  ostr << "continue training that rather than <w>"
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2126  ostr << "</w>. (Press <w>%</w> to see the skill "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2127  ostr << "management screen for the actual numbers.)"
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2136  ostr << "To attack a monster, "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2146  ostr << "To attack a monster, you can simply walk into it."
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2156  ostr << " can be <w>%</w>ired without the use of a launcher. "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2169  ostr << "Because of your horns you cannot wear helmets. "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2170  ostr << "(Press <w>%</w> to see a list of your mutations and "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2177  ostr << "Only nagas and armataurs can wear barding."
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2197  ostr << "\nNote that body armour with a high encumbrance "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2198  ostr << "rating may hinder your ability to cast spells. Light "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2199  ostr << "armour such as robes and leather armour will be "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2200  ostr << "generally safe for any aspiring spellcaster."
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2205  ostr << "\nNote that shields will hinder your ability to "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2206  ostr << "cast spells, until you've gained enough Shields "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2207  ostr << "skill to remove the penalty."
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2212  ostr << "\nNote that many ranged weapons are two handed and so "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2213  ostr << "cannot be used with an offhand item."
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2220  ostr << "\n\nWeapons and armour that have unusual descriptions "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2221  ostr << "like this are much more likely to be of higher "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2222  ostr << "enchantment or have special properties, good or bad."
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2228  ostr << "\n\nThis armour offers its wearer protection from "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2229  ostr << "certain sources. For an overview of your"
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2230  ostr << " resistances (among other things) press <w>%</w>"
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2232  ostr << " or click on your avatar with the <w>right mouse "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2240  ostr << "\n\nWhen worn, some types of armour (such as "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2241  ostr << "this one) offer certain <w>%</w>bilities you can "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2251  ostr << "The magic within can be unleashed by evoking "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2276  ostr << "Press <w>%</w> to read this scroll"
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2314  ostr << "\n\nWhen worn, some types of jewellery (such as this "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2315  ostr << "one) offer certain <w>%</w>bilities you can activate. "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2323  ostr << "Press <w>%</w> to quaff this potion"
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2335  ostr << "A manual can greatly help you in training a skill. "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2336  ostr << "After you pick one up, the skill in question will be "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2337  ostr << "trained more efficiently and will level up faster "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2338  ostr << "until you exhaust the manual's contents."
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2343  ostr << "\nYou can pick up a spellbook to add its spells to "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2344  ostr << "your spell library. (View your spell library with "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2353  ostr << "Skeletons and corpses can be used as components for "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2354  ostr << "certain necromantic spells. Apart from that, they are "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2359  ostr << "This staff can enhance your spellcasting, making spells "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2360  ostr << "of its related spell school more powerful."
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2379  ostr << " frowns upon the use of magic, this staff will be "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2380  ostr << "of little use to you and you might just as well "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2388  ostr << "Miscellaneous items sometimes harbour magical powers "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2389  ostr << "that can be harnessed by e<w>%</w>oking the item."
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2465  ostr << "These nasty constructions can cause a range of "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2466  ostr << "unpleasant effects. You won't be able to avoid "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2467  ostr << "tripping traps by flying over them; their magic "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2468  ostr << "construction will cause them to be triggered anyway."
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2473  ostr << "The dungeon contains a number of natural obstacles such "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2474  ostr << "as shafts, which lead one to three levels down. Once you "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2475  ostr << "know the shaft is there, you can safely step over it.\n"
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2476  ostr << "If you want to jump down there, use <w>></w> to do so. "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2477  ostr << "Be warned that getting back here might be difficult."
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2482  ostr << "Some areas of the dungeon, such as the Spider Nest, may "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2483  ostr << "be strewn with giant webs that may ensnare you for a short "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2484  ostr << "time. Insects, oozes and incorporeal entities can navigate "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2492  ostr << "You can enter the next (deeper) level by following them "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2493  ostr << "down (<w>></w>). To get back to this level again, "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2494  ostr << "press <w><<</w> while standing on the upstairs."
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2502  ostr << "\n\nYou have not yet passed through this particular "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2510  ostr << "These stairs lead out of the dungeon. Following them "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2511  ostr << "will end the game. The only way to win is to "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2512  ostr << "transport the fabled Orb of Zot outside."
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2518  ostr << "You can enter the previous (shallower) level by "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2519  ostr << "following these up (<w><<</w>). This is ideal for "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2520  ostr << "retreating or finding a safe resting spot, since the "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2521  ostr << "previous level will have less monsters, and monsters "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2522  ostr << "on this level can't follow you up unless they're "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2523  ostr << "standing right next to you. To get back to this "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2524  ostr << "level again, press <w>></w> while standing on the "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2532  ostr << "\n\nYou have not yet passed through this "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2533  ostr << "particular set of stairs. "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2540  ostr << "Escape hatches can be used to quickly leave a level with "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2541  ostr << "<w><<</w> and <w>></w>, respectively. Note that you will "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2542  ostr << "usually be unable to return right away."
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2558  ostr << "\nTo avoid accidentally opening a door you'd rather "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2559  ostr << "remain closed during travel or autoexplore, you can "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2560  ostr << "mark it with an exclusion from the map view "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2561  ostr << "(<w>X</w>) with <w>ee</w> while your cursor is on the "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2562  ostr << "grid in question. Such an exclusion will prevent "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2563  ostr << "autotravel from ever entering that grid until you "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2564  ostr << "remove the exclusion with another press of <w>Xe</w>."
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2576  ostr << "This is your chance to join a religion! In "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2577  ostr << "general, the gods will help their followers, "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2578  ostr << "bestowing powers of all sorts upon them, but many "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2579  ostr << "of them demand a life of dedication, constant "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2580  ostr << "tributes or entertainment in return.\n"
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2583  ostr << "This particular altar is so ancient that you "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2584  ostr << "cannot make out which god it is dedicated to! "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2585  ostr << "Converting here by pressing <w>></w> while "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2586  ostr << "standing on the altar will enter you into service "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2587  ostr << "of a random god, who will grant you some "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2588  ostr << "additional piety in thanks."
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2592  ostr << "You can get information about <w>"
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2594  ostr << "</w> by pressing <w>></w> while standing on the "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2595  ostr << "altar. Before taking up the responding faith "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2596  ostr << "you'll be asked for confirmation."
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2606  ostr << "This particular altar is so ancient that you cannot "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2607  ostr << "make out which god it is dedicated to, and "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2609  ostr << " probably won't like it if you switch allegiance. If "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2610  ostr << "you want to take the risk, you can convert here by "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2611  ostr << "pressing <w>></w> while standing on the altar. Doing "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2612  ostr << "so will enter you into service of a random god, who "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2613  ostr << "will grant you some additional piety in thanks."
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2618  ostr << " probably won't like it if you switch allegiance, "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2619  ostr << "but having a look won't hurt: to get information "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2622  ostr << "</w>, press <w>></w> while standing on the "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2623  ostr << "altar. Before taking up the responding faith (and "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2624  ostr << "abandoning your current one!) you'll be asked for "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2626  ostr << "\nTo see your current standing with "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2640  ostr << "An entryway into one of the many dungeon side branches in "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2643  ostr << "Beware, sometimes these can be deadly!"
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2673  ostr << "probably dangerous, and you should stay out of it if you "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2678  ostr << "currently harmless, but that could change at some point. "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2679  ostr << "Check the overview screen (<w>%</w>) to view your "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2687  ostr << " is opaque. If two or more opaque clouds are between "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2688  ostr << "you and a square, you won't be able to see anything in that "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2708  ostr << "Did you think you were the only adventurer in the dungeon? "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2709  ostr << "Well, you thought wrong! These unique adversaries often "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2710  ostr << "possess skills that normal monsters wouldn't, so be "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2716  ostr << "The ghost of a deceased adventurer, it would like nothing "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2717  ostr << "better than to send you the same way.\n\n"
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2725  ostr << "This monster appears to be really dangerous!\n"
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2730  ostr << "This monster appears to be quite dangerous.\n"
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2737  ostr << "A berserking monster is bloodthirsty and fighting madly. "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2738  ostr << "Such a blood rage makes it particularly dangerous!\n\n"
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2745  ostr << "Friendly monsters will follow you around and attempt to aid "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2746  ostr << "you in battle. You can order nearby allies by <w>t</w>alking "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2751  ostr << "\n\nHowever, it is only <w>temporarily</w> friendly, "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2752  ostr << "and will become dangerous again when this friendliness "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2760  ostr << "You can easily mark its square as dangerous to avoid "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2761  ostr << "accidentally entering into its field of view when using "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2762  ostr << "auto-explore or auto-travel. To do so, enter targeting "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2763  ostr << "mode with <w>x</w> and then press <w>e</w> when your "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2764  ostr << "cursor is hovering over the monster's grid. Doing so will "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2765  ostr << "mark this grid and all surrounding ones within a radius "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2766  ostr << "of 8 as "excluded" ones that explore or travel modes "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2771  ostr << "This might be a good time to run away"
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2774  ostr << " or apply your Berserk <w>a</w>bility"
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2780  ostr << "Apparently it has not noticed you - yet. Note that you do "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2781  ostr << "not have to engage every monster you meet. Sometimes, "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2782  ostr << "discretion is the better part of valour."
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2787  ostr << "Apparently it has been distracted by something. You could "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2788  ostr << "use this opportunity to sneak up on this monster - or to "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2794  ostr << "\nThis monster doesn't appear to have any resistances or "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2795  ostr << "susceptibilities. It cannot fly and is of average speed. "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2796  ostr << "Examining other, possibly more high-level monsters can give "
  [HIGH] hints.cc:2797  ostr << "important clues as to how to deal with them."
